2:T439,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","headline":"What Is the Law of Assumption? Complete Guide (Neville Goddard & Neuroscience)","description":"What is the Law of Assumption? Learn how Neville Goddard's Law of Assumption differs from the Law of Attraction, how it rewires your Reticular Activating System (RAS), and how to practice it.","datePublished":"2025-01-15","dateModified":"2026-11-20","articleSection":"Foundations","keywords":"what is the law of assumption, law of assumption vs law of attraction, neville goddard law of assumption, how to practice law of assumption, feeling of the wish fulfilled, reticular activating system manifestation","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://vibehyr.com/blog/what-is-the-law-of-assumption"},"author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Keisha Solomon","jobTitle":"Founder & Master Architect, Vibe Hyr"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Vibe Hyr","url":"https://vibehyr.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://vibehyr.com/icons/icon-512.png"}},"image":"https://vibehyr.com/images/og-image.png"}3:T472,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the main difference between the Law of Assumption and the Law of Attraction?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The Law of Attraction often focuses on trying to attract something external toward you through positive thinking, which can subtly reinforce the feeling that you do not have it yet. The Law of Assumption teaches that consciousness is the only reality: when you inwardly assume and occupy the feeling of already being the person whose wish is fulfilled, your perception, behavior, and external reality reorganize to match that assumption."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the neuroscience behind the Law of Assumption?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Your brainstem houses the Reticular Activating System (RAS), which filters 11 million bits of sensory data per second down to roughly 40–50 conscious bits based on your dominant beliefs. When you emotionally assume a new identity state, you reprogram the RAS search query to surface aligned opportunities, relationships, and synchronicities."}}]}8:["slug","what-is-the-law-of-assumption","d"]
